{"title":"Git与Github详解-实践篇","uid":"53c0810bf1b6ef29de73ed0f6cae304f","slug":"Git与Github详解-实践篇","date":"2025-05-12T17:12:28.000Z","updated":"2025-05-12T18:59:55.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Git与Github详解-实践篇.json","keywords":null,"cover":"https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.ijtKMya2lVcYvmNETyDx_gHaEK?cb=iwp2&pid=ImgDet&w=474&h=266&rs=1","content":"<h1 id=\"Git与Github详解：实践篇\"><a href=\"#Git与Github详解：实践篇\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Git与Github详解：实践篇\"></a>Git与Github详解：实践篇</h1><h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在上一篇文章中，我们详细了解了 Git 的基本概念、工作流和常用命令。在本文中，我们将通过一个实际的项目案例，来逐步演示如何在 GitHub 上进行代码托管和协作。</p>\n<p>本次演示仓库以我和国科大的好哥们共同开发的c语言围棋游戏为演示仓库 AstreoX&#x2F;CGo，其中的 <code>ai.c</code> 演示了一个基于蒙特卡洛树搜索（MCTS）的决策示例。本文将引导你从 <strong>安装配置</strong>、<strong>命令行操作</strong> 到 <strong>VS Code 可视化</strong>，一步步学会如何：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Fork &amp; Clone</li>\n<li>创建分支 &amp; 修改参数</li>\n<li>本地 Commit &amp; Push</li>\n<li>发起 Pull Request</li>\n<li>参与代码审阅与合并</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"安装与初始配置\"><a href=\"#安装与初始配置\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装与初始配置\"></a>安装与初始配置</h2><h3 id=\"1-安装-Git\"><a href=\"#1-安装-Git\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 安装 Git\"></a>1. 安装 Git</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Windows</strong>、<strong>macOS</strong>、<strong>Linux</strong> 均可从官网下载安装包：<div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">https://git-scm.com/download/</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>上一篇文章已有详细说明，这里不再赘述。</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>安装完成后，在终端（Windows PowerShell &#x2F; macOS Terminal &#x2F; Linux Shell）输入：<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">--version</span></span></code></pre></div>应看到类似 <code>git version 2.x.x</code> 的输出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-全局配置\"><a href=\"#2-全局配置\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 全局配置\"></a>2. 全局配置</h3><div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">config</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">--global</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">user.name</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">&quot;Your Name&quot;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">config</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">--global</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">user.email</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">&quot;you@example.com&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>这两个信息会出现在每次提交记录中。</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"3-注册-GitHub-账号\"><a href=\"#3-注册-GitHub-账号\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 注册 GitHub 账号\"></a>3. 注册 GitHub 账号</h3><ol>\n<li><p>打开 <a href=\"https://github.com/\">https://github.com</a> 并注册。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>完成邮箱验证。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>（强烈建议）在 <strong>Settings → SSH and GPG keys</strong> 添加你的 SSH 公钥，以便后续无需每次输入密码：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>首先我们在空白处右键，在右键菜单的更多选项中选择”Open Git Bash Here”</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/1.png\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/2.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<ul>\n<li><p>然后输入以下命令（邮箱记得替换成你自己的，注意不要有空格，然后一路无脑回车即可）：</p>\n<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">ssh-keygen</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">-t</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">ed25519</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">-C</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">&quot;you@example.com&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n<li><p>然后将生成的私钥添加到ssh-agent中：</p>\n<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #56B6C2\">eval</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">&quot;$(</span><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">ssh-agent</span><span style=\"color: #98C379\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">-s</span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">)&quot;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">ssh-add</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">~/.ssh/id_ed25519</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n<li><p>接着Git Bash中输入下面命令：</p>\n<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">cat</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n<li><p>然后将显示的公钥内容复制到剪贴板</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>然后打开GitHub，在右上角的头像菜单中选择”Settings”</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/3.png\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/4.png\" class=\"\">\n<ul>\n<li>然后在左侧菜单中选择 “SSH and GPG keys”</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/5.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>然后点击”New SSH key”</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/6.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Title 随便取一个，将刚刚复制的公钥内容粘贴到 Key 中，然后点击”Add SSH key”</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/7.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<ul>\n<li><p>至此，我们的SSH公钥就添加成功了</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>最后，我们可以测试一下是否成功：</p>\n<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">ssh</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">-T</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">git@github.com</span></span></code></pre></div><p>然后输入”yes”，如果显示”Hi username! You’ve successfully authenticated, but GitHub does not provide shell access.”，则说明成功了</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"Fork-amp-Clone-仓库\"><a href=\"#Fork-amp-Clone-仓库\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Fork &amp; Clone 仓库\"></a>Fork &amp; Clone 仓库</h2><p>无论命令行还是 VS Code，可视化，第一步都是 <strong>Fork</strong> 一份到自己账号并拉到本地。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p>访问我的仓库：</p>\n<div class=\"language-txt\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">txt</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #abb2bf\">https://github.com/AstreoX/CGo</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n<li><p>点击右上角 <strong>Fork</strong>，将仓库复制到 <code>yourname/CGo</code>。</p>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/8.png\" class=\"\">\n</li>\n<li><p>再进入到你Fork的仓库，点击 <strong>Code</strong>，复制仓库地址。</p>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/9.png\" class=\"\">\n</li>\n<li><p>在你本地的电脑上，创建一个合适的文件夹来作为项目目录（建议路径要为全英文），然后老样子右键点击空白处，选择”Open Git Bash Here”</p>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/1.png\" class=\"\">\n</li>\n<li><p>接着输入<code>git clone</code>空格之后，将你刚刚复制的仓库地址粘贴进去，然后回车即可</p>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/10.png\" class=\"\">\n</li>\n<li><p>此时，Git就会开始在本地克隆远程仓库的内容到你指定的目录中。</p>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/11.png\" class=\"\">\n</li>\n<li><p>然后，你就可以在本地看到克隆的仓库代码了。</p>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/12.png\" class=\"\"></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"传统命令行工作流\"><a href=\"#传统命令行工作流\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"传统命令行工作流\"></a>传统命令行工作流</h2><h3 id=\"初始化仓库-amp-添加上游\"><a href=\"#初始化仓库-amp-添加上游\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"初始化仓库 &amp; 添加上游\"></a>初始化仓库 &amp; 添加上游</h3><p>Git Bash窗口不要关掉，接着输入以下命令：</p>\n<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #56B6C2\">cd</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">CGo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #7F848E; font-style: italic\"># 添加上游指向原仓库（便于后续同步主分支）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">remote</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">add</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">upstream</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">https://github.com/AstreoX/CGo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">remote</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">-v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #7F848E; font-style: italic\"># 应看到 origin（你的仓库）和 upstream（原仓库）</span></span></code></pre></div><img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/13.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<h3 id=\"分支管理\"><a href=\"#分支管理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"分支管理\"></a>分支管理</h3><ol>\n<li><p>查看当前分支：</p>\n<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">branch</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n<li><p>创建并切换分支：</p>\n<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">checkout</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">-b</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">tune-mcts</span></span></code></pre></div></li>\n</ol>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/14.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<h3 id=\"修改-amp-提交\"><a href=\"#修改-amp-提交\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"修改 &amp; 提交\"></a>修改 &amp; 提交</h3><ol>\n<li><p>用你喜欢的编辑器打开 <code>src/ai.c</code>，在程序的第19-23行找到：</p>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/15.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<p>根据注释调整MCTS的搜索参数，做出一些修改</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>保存后回到命令行：</p>\n<p>使用以下命令查看文件状态：</p>\n<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">status</span></span></code></pre></div><img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/16.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<p>会看到src&#x2F;ai.c被标记为修改</p>\n<p>然后使用以下命令将修改添加到暂存区：</p>\n<div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">add</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">src/ai.c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">diff</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">--staged</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\">   </span><span style=\"color: #7F848E; font-style: italic\"># 查看暂存区对比，能看到你改动了代码的哪些地方</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">commit</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">-m</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">&quot;在这里记录你修改的参数，例如：Tune MCTS: sim=2000, exploration=1.20&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div><img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/17.png\" class=\"\"></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"推送-amp-发起-Pull-Request\"><a href=\"#推送-amp-发起-Pull-Request\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"推送 &amp; 发起 Pull Request\"></a>推送 &amp; 发起 Pull Request</h3><div class=\"language-bash\"><button title=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #7F848E; font-style: italic\"># 推送到你远程仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #61AFEF\">git</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">push</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #D19A66\">-u</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">origin</span><span style=\"color: #ABB2BF\"> </span><span style=\"color: #98C379\">tune-mcts</span></span></code></pre></div><img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/18.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>之后访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/yourname/CGo\">https://github.com/yourname/CGo</a></li>\n<li>页面会提示 “Compare &amp; pull request”，说明你已经成功推送了分支，需要发起 Pull Request。</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/19.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>点击 “Create pull request”，填写标题和描述，然后点击 “Create pull request”。</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/20.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>然后就会跳转到Pull Request页面，你可以在这里查看你的改动、发起评论、参与讨论等。</li>\n<li>这里显示没有代码冲突，直接点击 “Merge pull request” 即可。</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/21.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>然后点击 “Confirm merge” 即可完成合并。</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/22.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>然后就可以看到你的改动已经被合并到主分支了。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"VS-Code-可视化工作流\"><a href=\"#VS-Code-可视化工作流\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"VS Code 可视化工作流\"></a>VS Code 可视化工作流</h2><p>在刚刚克隆到本地的代码仓库，右键选择”Open with Code”，或者直接在VS Code中打开该文件夹，就可以开始可视化操作了。</p>\n<h3 id=\"安装必备扩展\"><a href=\"#安装必备扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安装必备扩展\"></a>安装必备扩展</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>GitLens — Git supercharged</strong>：增强代码注释与历史浏览。</li>\n<li><strong>GitHub Pull Requests and Issues</strong>：在 VS Code 中直接浏览&#x2F;发起 PR。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"分支与改动管理\"><a href=\"#分支与改动管理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"分支与改动管理\"></a>分支与改动管理</h3><ul>\n<li><p><strong>切换&#x2F;创建分支</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>点击下方加号 → “Create new branch” → 输入 <code>tune-mcts-2</code> → 按回车创建</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/22.png\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"/post/Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3-%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87/24.png\" class=\"\">\n\n<p>这里会出现三个选项，我们只需要关心前两个，分别是单纯的创建分支、创建分支并切换到该分支。<br>根据自己的喜好选择即可（一般情况下，我们选择创建分支并切换到该分支）</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>查看改动</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 <strong>源代码管理</strong> 面板能看到所有未暂存与已暂存的文件</li>\n<li>点击文件名可打开 diff 视图</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"修改-amp-提交-1\"><a href=\"#修改-amp-提交-1\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"修改 &amp; 提交\"></a>修改 &amp; 提交</h3><ol>\n<li>在资源管理器中打开 <code>src/ai.c</code>，修改参数并保存。</li>\n<li>在 <strong>源代码管理</strong> 面板：<ul>\n<li>将 <code>ai.c</code> 拖动到 “Staged Changes”</li>\n<li>在上方输入提交信息：<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>Tune MCTS: sim&#x3D;2000, exploration&#x3D;1.20</p></blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>点击 ✓ 提交</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"推送-amp-发起-PR\"><a href=\"#推送-amp-发起-PR\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"推送 &amp; 发起 PR\"></a>推送 &amp; 发起 PR</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>推送</strong>：顶部会出现 “Publish Branch” 按钮，点击即可。</li>\n<li><strong>发起 PR</strong>：<ul>\n<li>安装 “GitHub Pull Requests and Issues” 后，点击左侧 “GitHub” 图标</li>\n<li>选择 “Create Pull Request” → 目标库选择 <code>AstreoX/CGo</code> → 填写标题和描述 → 提交</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\"><a href=\"#总结\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"总结\"></a>总结</h2><p>通过以上 <strong>命令行 + VS Code 可视化</strong> 的方式进行版本控制，我们可以更方便地管理代码，并与他人协作。在实际开发中，我们可以根据需要灵活选择适合自己的版本控制方式，以提高开发效率。</p>\n<p>无论是通过命令行还是可视化工具，Git 和 GitHub 的核心概念和工作流程都是一致的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fork 仓库到自己账号</li>\n<li>Clone 到本地进行开发</li>\n<li>创建功能分支进行修改</li>\n<li>提交并推送更改</li>\n<li>发起 Pull Request 进行代码审阅</li>\n<li>合并到主分支</li>\n</ul>\n<p>掌握了这些基本操作，你就可以参与到开源项目的协作中，或者在团队开发中高效地进行版本控制了。 </p>\n","text":"Git与Github详解：实践篇前言在上一篇文章中，我们详细了解了 Git 的基本概念、工作流和常用命令。在本文中，我们将通过一个实际的项目案例，来逐步演示如何...","permalink":"/post/Git与Github详解-实践篇","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"3.7k","symbolsTime":"3 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"技术","slug":"技术","count":1,"path":"api/categories/技术.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"技术","slug":"技术","count":4,"path":"api/tags/技术.json"},{"name":"Git","slug":"Git","count":1,"path":"api/tags/Git.json"},{"name":"Github","slug":"Github","count":2,"path":"api/tags/Github.json"},{"name":"教程","slug":"教程","count":2,"path":"api/tags/教程.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-1\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#Git%E4%B8%8EGithub%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E7%AF%87\"><span class=\"toc-text\">Git与Github详解：实践篇</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%89%8D%E8%A8%80\"><span class=\"toc-text\">前言</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE\"><span class=\"toc-text\">安装与初始配置</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#1-%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85-Git\"><span class=\"toc-text\">1. 安装 Git</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#2-%E5%85%A8%E5%B1%80%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE\"><span class=\"toc-text\">2. 全局配置</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#3-%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C-GitHub-%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7\"><span class=\"toc-text\">3. 注册 GitHub 账号</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#Fork-amp-Clone-%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93\"><span class=\"toc-text\">Fork &amp; Clone 仓库</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BC%A0%E7%BB%9F%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A1%8C%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81\"><span class=\"toc-text\">传统命令行工作流</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93-amp-%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E4%B8%8A%E6%B8%B8\"><span class=\"toc-text\">初始化仓库 &amp; 添加上游</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86\"><span class=\"toc-text\">分支管理</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9-amp-%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4\"><span class=\"toc-text\">修改 &amp; 提交</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81-amp-%E5%8F%91%E8%B5%B7-Pull-Request\"><span class=\"toc-text\">推送 &amp; 发起 Pull Request</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#VS-Code-%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%86%E5%8C%96%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81\"><span class=\"toc-text\">VS Code 可视化工作流</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E5%BF%85%E5%A4%87%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95\"><span class=\"toc-text\">安装必备扩展</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%94%B9%E5%8A%A8%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86\"><span class=\"toc-text\">分支与改动管理</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9-amp-%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4-1\"><span class=\"toc-text\">修改 &amp; 提交</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81-amp-%E5%8F%91%E8%B5%B7-PR\"><span class=\"toc-text\">推送 &amp; 发起 PR</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93\"><span class=\"toc-text\">总结</span></a></li></ol></li></ol>","author":{"name":"AstreoX","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatars/astreox.jpg","link":"/","description":"404 AstreoX not Found","socials":{}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"大语言模型P1","uid":"01ada737b1644154f9d4511dc216943b","slug":"大语言模型P1","date":"2025-05-24T08:54:03.000Z","updated":"2025-08-04T08:20:41.682Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/大语言模型P1.json","keywords":null,"cover":"大语言模型P1/cover.png","text":"北京大语言模型实践 Day 1​ 来到北京第一天，参加大语言模型的实践。 ​ 今天北京真的是格外的冷，零下19度，还有大风呼呼的吹，本来带了两件外套想着轮着穿，...","permalink":"/post/大语言模型P1","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"3k","symbolsTime":"3 mins."},"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"AI","slug":"AI","count":3,"path":"api/tags/AI.json"},{"name":"技术","slug":"技术","count":4,"path":"api/tags/技术.json"},{"name":"自然语言处理","slug":"自然语言处理","count":2,"path":"api/tags/自然语言处理.json"}],"author":{"name":"AstreoX","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatars/astreox.jpg","link":"/","description":"404 AstreoX not Found","socials":{}}},"next_post":{"title":"Github详解: 从入门到精通","uid":"647c4edecec5c6b48ebc0d64a7cb455e","slug":"Github详解-从入门到精通","date":"2025-05-11T16:07:54.000Z","updated":"2025-11-26T06:52:07.703Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Github详解-从入门到精通.json","keywords":null,"cover":"https://imgconvert.csdnimg.cn/aHR0cHM6Ly91cGxvYWQtaW1hZ2VzLmppYW5zaHUuaW8vdXBsb2FkX2ltYWdlcy8xOTM0MTk4My05YjI2Y2RkOTM3NjA0NmE4LnBuZw?x-oss-process=image/format,png","text":"Git 与 GitHub 详解：从入门到精通引言哎呀也是叫我用上“从入门到精通”这个经典标题了，鉴于很多人搞不懂Git和Github的关系，而且也不怎么会使用G...","permalink":"/post/Github详解-从入门到精通","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"12k","symbolsTime":"11 mins."},"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"技术","slug":"技术","count":4,"path":"api/tags/技术.json"},{"name":"Github","slug":"Github","count":2,"path":"api/tags/Github.json"},{"name":"教程","slug":"教程","count":2,"path":"api/tags/教程.json"},{"name":"入门","slug":"入门","count":2,"path":"api/tags/入门.json"}],"author":{"name":"AstreoX","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatars/astreox.jpg","link":"/","description":"404 AstreoX not Found","socials":{}}}}